Discord](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/discord.95/)\n  * [Hub](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/hub.75/)\n  * [Issues](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/issues.14/)\n  * [Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n    * [Notable Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n    * [Current Visitors](https://www.spigotmc.org/online/)\n    * [Recent Activity](https://www.spigotmc.org/recent-activity/)\n    * [New Profile Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/profile-posts)\n  * [Donate](https://www.spigotmc.org/pages/donate/)\n\n\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/) \n\nYour username or email address:\n     \n\nPassword:\n    \n[Forgot your password?](https://www.spigotmc.org/lost-password/)      Stay logged in\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/)\n  * [ Menu ](https://www.spigotmc.org/)\n  * [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * [Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n\n\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n# BungeeCord\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) Dec 13, 2014\n  * [Discussion (178)](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/bungeecord.2774/unread)\n\n\n  * [Page](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/#wikiContent)\n  * [History](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/#history)\n  * [Editors](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/#editors)\n\n\n  * ![\\[​IMG\\]](https://proxy.spigotmc.org/0e97ad6ff9f812673c4274b355fb5aa8289bc6e9/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4d41673272324a2e706e67)​\n  \n**Getting Started** ​\n    * [About BungeeCord](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/about-bungeecord/)\n    * [Installation](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-installation/)\n**Using BungeeCord** ​\n    * [Configuration guide (config.yml)](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-configuration-guide/)\n    * [Firewall guide](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/firewall-guide)\n    * [Commands](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-commands/)\n    * [Report an issue](https://github.com/ElasticPortalSuite/BungeeCord/issues)\n**Downloads** ​\n    * [Downloads](http://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/bungeecord.28/)\n    * [BungeeCord Plugins](http://www.spigotmc.org/resources/categories/bungee-proxy.3/)\n    * [Changelog](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/changelog/?noRedirect=1)\n**Developers** ​\n    * [BungeeCord plugin development](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-plugin-development/)\n    * [GitHub](https://github.com/SpigotMC/BungeeCord/)\n  * Loading...\n  * Loading...\n\n\n(1644635 Views) \nLast Modified: Dec 13, 2014 at 7:21 PM \n[XenCarta PRO](http://xenforo.com/community/resources/1690/) © Jason Axelrod from [8WAYRUN.COM](http://8wayrun.com/)\n### Sponsors\n[ ![Minecraft Server List](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/minecraft-server-list.png) ](https://minecraft-server-list.com/ \"Looking for a server to play Minecraft on or to extend your servers playerbase? Minecraft Server List is an extensive list of Minecraft servers from around the world. Submit your server, let your players vote for it and gain even more players forward.\") [ ![Aternos](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/aternos.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/aternos \"Minecraft servers. Free. Forever.\") [ ![Tebex Donation Plugin & Webstore](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/tebex.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/tebex \"Struggling to cover the costs of your Minecraft Server? Setup your\nown webstore with Tebex in under 30 seconds.\")\n[Sign up now!](https://www.spigotmc.org/register/)\n### Wiki Navigation\n  * **BungeeCord**\n  * [About BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/about-bungeecord/)\n  * [BungeeCord Commands](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-commands/)\n  * [BungeeCord Configuration Guide](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-configuration-guide/)\n  * [BungeeCord FAQ](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-faq/)\n  * [BungeeCord Installation](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-installation/)\n  * [BungeeCord Maven](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-maven/)\n  * [BungeeCord Modules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-modules/)\n  * [BungeeCord Plugin Development](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-plugin-development/)\n  * [Creating basic command functions in BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/creating-basic-command-functions-in-bungeecord/)\n\n\n### [Wiki Index](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * **BungeeCord**\n  * [Forums](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/forums/)\n  * [Spigot](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot/)\n\n\n### Top Editors \n\n[Mineplugins](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/mineplugins.173014/)\n    386 \n\n[smmmadden](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/smmmadden.104514/)\n    375 \n\n[Jeppa](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/jeppa.50435/)\n    373 \n\n[RockinChaos](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/rockinchaos.3051/)\n    343 \n\n[Maximvdw](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/maximvdw.6687/)\n    325 \n\n[Blackixx](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/blackixx.649/)\n    235 \n\n[Indyuce](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/indyuce.253965/)\n    230 \n\n[BrettPlays](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/brettplays.80037/)\n    205 \n\n[Phoenix616](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/phoenix616.3651/)\n    191 \n\n[Zrips](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/zrips.24572/)\n    179\n### Wiki Statistics \n\nPages:\n    1,407 \n\nEdits:\n    13,453 \n\nLikes:\n    0 \n\nViews:\n    39,877,325 \n\nAttached Files:\n    13 (318.6 KB)\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) \n\nStyle\n\n  * [FAQ](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/311785/)\n  * [Contact Us](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/contact-us.321793/)\n  * [Terms](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-terms/)\n  * [Rules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-rules/)\n  * [Privacy Policy](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-privacy/)\n\n\